        "TileImage": "$($repository 671746f4-eecd-417d-b0cd-1ad49e88f0c2).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings 47. Your target is Catalina Delgado, wife to client Rico Delgado. The client claims that his wife has been nagging him about getting rid of his favorite tattoo and has even had a world-famous tattoo artist fly out to Santa Fortuna to give him the tattoo in the cartel&apos;s private mansion. You are to eliminate the target before the Rico meets with the tattoo artist and do so inconspicuously - it is crucial that there is no trace or evidence left behind. Good luck, 47.",
